1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 9=

10
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:49,510
In the previous life,

11
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:51,470
Prince Qi killed Consort Great Liu.

12
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:54,150
That's why this case remained unsolved.

13
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:55,640
That also proves

14
00:00:56,110 --> 00:00:57,430
he was

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
the mastermind behind it.

16
00:01:02,190 --> 00:01:03,470
After Consort Great Liu vanished,

17
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,950
Consort Little Liu took advantage

18
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:06,640
of His Majesty's longing for her sister

19
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,070
and became his favorite.

20
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,590
She later gave birth to Prince Qi.

21
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,230
So the murderer is...

22
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:21,150
- Consort Little Liu
- Consort Little Liu.

23
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:25,420
(Consort Little Liu, Prince Qi's mother)

24
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,310
That's also why

25
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:28,070
I must

26
00:01:28,070 --> 00:01:29,760
secure my place in the Qi family.

27
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,150
Only then

28
00:01:31,350 --> 00:01:32,870
can I find the evidence

29
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:34,120
before Prince Qi does,

30
00:01:34,310 --> 00:01:35,200
uncover the truth,

31
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:38,200
and bring peace to the souls of Prince
Consort and the Commandery Princess.

32
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:39,640
Qi Yuan,

33
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:42,950
this tale of rebirth is hard to believe.

34
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,840
Yunting may believe you,

35
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:47,120
but I do not.

36
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:50,230
Still, if you can bring to justice

37
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:51,680
the ones who murdered Prince Consort

38
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,920
and Commandery Princess,

39
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:55,040
I will give you

40
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,070
my full support.

41
00:01:58,820 --> 00:01:59,840
Thank you, Your Highness.

42
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,070
Eldest Princess.

43
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:04,680
Prince Jing.

44
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,300
Oil was found in the ancestral hall.

45
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:07,310
The fire was no accident.

46
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:08,590
It was arson.

47
00:02:09,590 --> 00:02:10,680
Since that's the case,

48
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,150
whoever tries to stop you
from acknowledging your family

49
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:14,590
is opposing me.

50
00:02:14,870 --> 00:02:16,000
I'd like to see

51
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,080
who's pulling the strings
behind the scenes.

52
00:02:18,510 --> 00:02:19,690
Rest assured, Eldest Princess.

53
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,310
I know who it is.

54
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,840
You've all waited long enough.

55
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,120
As for the fire,

56
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,870
I've heard

57
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:33,120
something rather interesting.

58
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:34,030
Shunzi,

59
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,000
tell everyone

60
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,280
who sent you to buy the lamp oil.

61
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,280
It was...

62
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,220
(Shunzi, servant of the Qi Residence)

63
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,430
It was Young Lady Han Yue'e.

64
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:47,910
Nonsense!

65
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:49,590
Young Lady Qi,

66
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:50,910
Young Lady Han

67
00:02:50,910 --> 00:02:52,180
went to see the Young Master
late that night

68
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,520
and urged him
to burn down the ancestral hall

69
00:02:53,545 --> 00:02:54,840
to ruin your welcome ceremony.

70
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,080
Han Yue'e?

71
00:02:56,430 --> 00:02:58,750
(Prince Qi sent her.)

72
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,590
Your Highness.

73
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:00,840
(But she'd always stayed in the shadows)

74
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,220
(and never made a move against me.)

75
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:04,030
(Why did she act ahead of time?)

76
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:05,630
(Could it be...)

77
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:08,080
(Is Prince Qi like me?)

78
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,590
(Has he...)

79
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,120
Yue'e,

80
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,430
tell us what happened.

81
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:14,750
Uncle,

82
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,960
my father died on the battlefield.

83
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,080
I was raised in the Qi Residence
since I was little.

84
00:03:19,150 --> 00:03:20,710
The Qi family's honor is my own too.

85
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:23,400
What good would burning it down do me?

86
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:29,960
Father,

87
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,150
see for yourself.

88
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,000
These record
the Qi family's daily affairs,

89
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:38,990
the movements of everyone,

90
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,600
and Yuan's schedule for returning home.

91
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,030
Han Yue'e,

92
00:03:42,810 --> 00:03:44,310
the Qi family is a military household.

93
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,190
(Qi Yuan returned home)
Leaking such information to outsiders

94
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,750
is no different from aiding the enemy.

95
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,430
(I burned them.)

96
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:50,470
Impossible!

97
00:03:50,470 --> 00:03:51,400
I didn't write these.

98
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:57,470
These letters were found in your room.

99
00:03:57,870 --> 00:03:59,400
The handwriting is yours as well.

100
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:02,710
Who exactly have you been writing to?

101
00:04:03,150 --> 00:04:04,280
Don't you slander me.

102
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,080
If you won't say, it's fine.

103
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,400
These letters bear

104
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,150
that person's

105
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:10,630
"Dragon Roaming the Seven Seas" seal.

106
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,910
We'll find out who it is.

107
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:14,400
Dragon Roaming the Seven Seas Seal?

108
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:15,520
Isn't that...

109
00:04:15,530 --> 00:04:16,430
It's Prince Qi's seal.

110
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:18,240
Prince Qi?

111
00:04:20,750 --> 00:04:21,750
Prince Qi...

112
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:23,950
Why would he spy on us?

113
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,990
Could someone in our manor
have been watching us all along?

114
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,160
Spying on court officials

115
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,120
is a grave crime.

116
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,830
Exactly.

117
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,070
(If this implicates Prince Qi,)

118
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,680
(he'll kill me.)

119
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:35,870
Han Yue'e.

120
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:38,480
Tell us the truth.

121
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,630
His Highness is of noble origin.

122
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:42,120
How could an orphan like me

123
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:43,600
know me?

124
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,190
Hold on, Young Lady Han.

125
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,160
I recall you saying

126
00:04:47,210 --> 00:04:48,830
that Second Young Lady had already left,

127
00:04:49,110 --> 00:04:51,040
and if the Eldest Young Lady
were driven out too,

128
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,040
the Qi family would have no choice

129
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,260
but to marry you to Prince Qi.

130
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,270
When did I ever say that?

131
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:56,430
You're lying!

132
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,510
So that's how it is.

133
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:02,000
If you and Prince Qi

134
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,070
are in love,

135
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:05,800
you could've just said so.

136
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,680
Why make everyone believe

137
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,310
that Prince Qi has been spying on us?

138
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,190
If Prince Qi had spied on officials,

139
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:13,870
then by the laws of the realm,

140
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:14,950
not only you,

141
00:05:14,950 --> 00:05:17,190
but Prince Qi himself
would be held accountable.

142
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,480
Don't try to fool me.

143
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:21,750
I've never exchanged letters
with Prince Qi.

144
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,560
What a pity.

145
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:27,390
I had hoped that on my happy day,

146
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:30,000
before Prince Jing
and the Eldest Princess,

147
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:31,580
I could help bring you together.

148
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,000
What are you trying to do?

149
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,390
Han Yue'e has sent word.

150
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:37,720
The plan succeeded.

151
00:05:37,730 --> 00:05:39,630
Qi Yuan has been
driven out of the Qi Residence.

152
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,120
Qi Yuan,

153
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:44,190
what good are your schemes now?

154
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:46,090
Without the Qi Residence to shelter you,

155
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:47,920
where else can you go

156
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,040
but stay by my side?

157
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:52,390
I'll take very good care of you

158
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:55,680
until you willingly submit to me.

159
00:05:56,210 --> 00:05:58,510
Congratulations, Your Highness.
Your wish has come true.

160
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:01,630
I will personally

161
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:05,040
go to the Qi Residence to bring her back.

162
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,830
From this moment on,

163
00:06:15,830 --> 00:06:17,270
you belong to me alone.

164
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,240
Never again shall we be parted.

165
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:31,800
Your Highness.

166
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:38,560
Congratulations!

167
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:42,360
You've finally won your beloved woman.

168
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,680
The Qi Residence's expenditures

169
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,870
and troop movements
are important.

170
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:55,560
I have recorded everything.

171
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:58,190
I also heard that
the missing daughter of Marquis Yongping

172
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:59,870
returned home a few days ago.

173
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,800
Take good care of her.

174
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,240
Your Highness,

175
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:06,600
this letter

176
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,750
bears your
"Dragon Roaming the Seven Seas" seal.

177
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,420
If not for exchanging words of love,

178
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:12,600
then was it to spy on court officials?

179
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:13,750
Uncle,

180
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:15,510
everyone here has witnessed this now.

181
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:18,310
If word reaches His Majesty,

182
00:07:18,530 --> 00:07:20,240
it will no longer
be a mere family matter.

183
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:22,720
Prince Jing, there's no need
to exaggerate matters.

184
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:28,070
I've long been in love with Yue'e.

185
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:29,830
My conscience is clear.

186
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:31,310
Very well.

187
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,800
Guards.

188
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:35,120
Send Young Lady Han
to Prince Qi's Residence.

189
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,870
Marquis Yongping,

190
00:07:37,270 --> 00:07:39,310
you've truly raised your daughter well.

191
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,990
Your adopted daughter
is getting married,

192
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,360
yet your own daughter
is deciding this matter on her own.

193
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:50,430
Miss Qi may have overstepped,

194
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:52,160
but she meant to bring about
a good match.

195
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:54,070
Surely you don't mind, Uncle?

196
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:57,120
My welcome ceremony

197
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,720
was set on the most auspicious day.

198
00:07:58,950 --> 00:07:59,950
Such a lucky day is rare.

199
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:03,190
Why not make it
a double celebration today?

200
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:07,000
Very well.

201
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,920
I thank you for your kindness.

202
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:13,800
Congratulations, Your Highness.

203
00:08:14,110 --> 00:08:16,300
- Congratulations, Your Highness.
- Congratulations, Your Highness.

204
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:17,420
(Zhuque, Prince Qi's Guard)

205
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:22,000
You...

206
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:24,560
All of you...

207
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:27,560
Very well.

208
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,900
(Prince Qi Residence)

209
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:34,960
Your Highness,

210
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,270
I honestly don't know.

211
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,720
I burned those letters long ago.

212
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,960
I don't know where she found them.

213
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,240
Could it be those letters and seals

214
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:44,870
were all forged by her?

215
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:54,510
If you do one thing for me,

216
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,550
I will not only forgive everything,

217
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,240
but also make you my Princess Consort.

218
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:02,120
All you need to do
is return to the Qi Residence.

219
00:09:10,290 --> 00:09:11,270
Thank you, Your Highness.

220
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:14,480
I will do everything in my power.

221
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,720
Qi Yuan,

222
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:27,630
not just anyone

223
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:29,600
gets to touch me the way you do.

224
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:32,790
We are meant for each other.

225
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,630
Not even death can part us.

226
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,030
You are destined to be mine.

227
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,910
Qi Yuan...

228
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:59,170
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

229
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:03,330
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

230
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:09,300
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

231
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:13,680
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

232
00:10:14,470 --> 00:10:18,750
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

233
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:26,450
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
